      ],
      "why": "review is reasoning-heavy and output-light; Grok 4.6 is cheapest relative to capability there (2.4x cheaper than Opus 5 for the same review). Hard operating rule: Grok's non-hallucination rate is ~65.7% — confirm every citation against the named file or line before acting on it (model-matrix.md Table 4b)."
    },
    {
