      "class": "WORKHORSE",
      "kind": "settled",
      "evidence": "published Grok pricing policy (model-matrix.md Table 3); agy context ceilings are unmeasured (model-matrix.md Table 1) so this job stays off AGY until they're known",
      "default": [
