        { "provider": "gateway-api", "model": "sonnet" },
        { "provider": "gateway-api", "model": "fable", "note": "EXCLUDED 2026-09-28 — DEGRADED/UNVERIFIED (2 consecutive timeouts), see never_request; routing-card.py skips it automatically" },
        { "provider": "codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-terra" }
      ],
      "why": "Grok reprices the whole request 2x above 200K and is ineligible outright above 500K; Sonnet 5 has no length surcharge up to 1M and is the only seat here with a documented large context ceiling — AGY is deliberately not listed (its context limits are unmeasured, model-matrix.md Table 1; do not route a large-context ticket to an unmeasured ceiling). Gateway seats added ahead of Codex under 2026-09-25_v2 (Codex is RESERVE, tried only after the gateway pool is also exhausted)."
    },
    {
      "id": "no-frontier-implementation",
      "label": "Implementation ticket when AGY, Claude-in-AGY, and the gateway seats are ALL unavailable — Codex reserve of last resort",
